window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Tiger shifter Zaria is deeply connected to Thornapple Valley’s magic, gifted with a rare ability called the Sight. Through the valley’s thornapples, she watches the borders and keeps the town’s shifter residents safe—like a scout. But now she needs her magic to do more.</p> <p>An unconscious grizzly-bear shifter has been brought in, his body marked by dark magic. No one knows how to save him—except maybe Zaria. She feels an unexplainable bond to this stranger, something that tugs at her soul.</p> <p>She’s never given much thought to soulmates… but hers is dying. And unless she can cleanse the magic killing him, she’ll lose him before she gets the chance to know him.</p> <p>—</p> <p><i>Thornapple Valley is a shifter-friendly community. Its residents are either shifters themselves or they accept and protect shifters. There is safety in a town like this. Shifters can live their lives and be who they are without fear. It’s the perfect place to settle down. And even when things don’t go exactly as planned, love always finds a way.</i></p> <p><i>Each book in this series is short and sweet with mild or no spice</i></p>"; 
